### ============================================================
### 04 · 生鲜航班保障节点台账 /api/special（records_special，主键 = 整数自增）
### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 一行 = 「某个航班的保障节点」快照，节点内容整包放在 nodes（JSONB）里。
###
### ★ 两点和常见设计不一样，测试时留意：
###   1. 库里**没有 belongTime 列** —— 「归属日期」不落库，分天时统一按
###      createTime 的**北京日**算（返回里的 createdDate / updateDate 就是这个口径）。
###   2. 库里**没有业务唯一约束** —— 所以 POST 永远新增一条、**不会 409**；
###      要覆盖已有台账必须带 id 走 PUT /:id，服务端不做「按航班号猜一条」的隐式 upsert。
###      （真要「一天一个航班一份」，得在 schema 上补 @@unique，再改成 Prisma 原生 upsert）
###
### 时间字段口径：
###   createTime / updateTime  → ISO 字符串（UTC 绝对时刻，timestamptz）
###   createdDate / updateDate → 上面那俩换算到 Asia/Shanghai 的日期
###
### 顺序：A 列表/详情 → B CRUD（自建自删）→ C 关联航班
### ============================================================

@host = http://localhost:5183
@callsign = SP0001


### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### A. 列表 / 详情
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.1 列表（初始为空）
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/special


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.2 按航班号过滤
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/special?callsign={{callsign}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.3 按航班（uuid）过滤 —— 三个外键列 OR
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/special?flightUuid=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.4 按「创建日（北京）」过滤
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/special?date=2026-10-05


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.5 日期区间（闭区间）
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/special?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.6 详情：非整数 id → 404
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/special/abc

### 期望 404：{ "error": "records_special 里没有 id=abc 的记录" }


### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### B. 新增 → 查询 → 更新 → 删除
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.7 新增 —— 必填 callsign；nodes 不传默认 {}
### nodes 里塞什么随业务，服务端只认一个约定：
###   nodes.freshMark 非空 → 该航班在 /api/fips 里 is_fresh = true
### ------------------------------------------------------------
# @name created
POST {{host}}/api/special
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "callsign": "{{callsign}}",
  "nodes": {
    "freshMark": "生鲜",
    "arrival": "2026-10-05 09:10:00",
    "unloadStart": "2026-10-05 09:25:00",
    "unloadEnd": "2026-10-05 09:48:00",
    "coldStorage": true,
    "remark": "2 板 3 箱，优先卸机"
  }
}

### 期望 201：
### { "id": 1, "callsign": "SP0001", "nodes": { … },
###   "createTime": "2026-10-04T16:58:00.000Z",   ← ISO(UTC)
###   "updateTime": "2026-10-04T16:58:00.000Z",
###   "createdDate": "2026-10-05", "updateDate": "2026-10-05",   ← 北京日
###   "source": null, "flight_uuid": null }


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.8 详情
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/special/{{created.response.body.$.id}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.9 局部更新 —— 只传要改的列（nodes 整体替换，不是深合并）
### updateTime 会被服务端自动刷新
### ------------------------------------------------------------
PUT {{host}}/api/special/{{created.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nodes": {
    "freshMark": "生鲜",
    "coldStorage": true,
    "remark": "已全部卸机"
  }
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.10 只改 callsign（nodes 不动）
### ------------------------------------------------------------
PUT {{host}}/api/special/{{created.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "callsign": "SP0001B"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.11 清空 nodes —— 传 null 会写成 SQL NULL（不是 JSON null）
### ------------------------------------------------------------
PUT {{host}}/api/special/{{created.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nodes": null
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.12 校验：缺 callsign → 400（callsign 是 NOT NULL 列）
### ------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/api/special
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nodes": { "freshMark": "生鲜" }
}

### 期望 400：{ "error": "callsign（航班号）不能为空" }


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.13 校验：flightUuid 不是 uuid → 400
### ------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/api/special
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "callsign": "{{callsign}}",
  "flightUuid": "not-a-uuid"
}

### 期望 400：{ "error": "flightUuid 必须是 uuid：not-a-uuid" }


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.14 校验：flightUuid 是合法 uuid 但库里没有 → 404
### ------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/api/special
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "callsign": "{{callsign}}",
  "flightUuid": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### 期望 404：{ "error": "找不到航班 00000000-…" }


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.15 更新不存在的记录 → 404
### ------------------------------------------------------------
PUT {{host}}/api/special/99999999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nodes": { "freshMark": "生鲜" }
}

### 期望 404：{ "error": "records_special 里没有 id=99999999 的记录" }


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.16 没有唯一约束的证明：同一 callsign 再 POST 一次，仍是 201（不是 409）
### ------------------------------------------------------------
# @name dup
POST {{host}}/api/special
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "callsign": "SP0001B",
  "nodes": { "freshMark": "生鲜" }
}

### 期望 201（新的一条）。跑完记得删掉，见 4.18


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.17 删除（4.7 建的那条）
### ------------------------------------------------------------
DELETE {{host}}/api/special/{{created.response.body.$.id}}

### 期望 200：{ "ok": true, "id": 1 }


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.18 删除 4.16 多出来的那条
### ------------------------------------------------------------
DELETE {{host}}/api/special/{{dup.response.body.$.id}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.19 收尾：按航班号查，期望 total = 0
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/special?callsign=SP0001B


### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### C. 关联航班（外键）—— 和 06_flow.http 里的完整链路对应
### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 传 flightUuid 时服务端会：
###   1. 去三张航班表逐个 findUnique，判定它属于哪张表（找不到 → 404）
###   2. 用 fkPatch 把三个外键列全部清空，再只设命中的那一列
###      → 一条记录永远最多挂一个航班
###   3. flightUuid 传 null / 空串，表示「解绑」，三个外键列全部清空
### ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.20 建一个手动航班（供下面挂靠用）
### ------------------------------------------------------------
# @name flight
POST {{host}}/api/fips?source=manual_fips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flightNo": "SP-LINK-01",
  "sobt": "2026-10-05 08:00:00"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.21 新增台账并挂到上面这个航班上
### 返回里 source = "manual_fips"、flight_uuid = 航班 uuid
### ------------------------------------------------------------
# @name linked
POST {{host}}/api/special
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "callsign": "SP-LINK-01",
  "flightUuid": "{{flight.response.body.$.uuid}}",
  "nodes": { "freshMark": "生鲜", "remark": "挂靠测试" }
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.22 按航班 uuid 反查台账 —— 期望 total = 1
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/special?flightUuid={{flight.response.body.$.uuid}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.23 这条台账挂上去之后，航班详情里的 specialCount / is_fresh 会变
### 期望：specialCount = 1，is_fresh = true，fresh_content = "生鲜"
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/fips/{{flight.response.body.$.uuid}}?source=manual_fips


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.24 解绑 —— flightUuid 传 null，三个外键列全清空
### ------------------------------------------------------------
PUT {{host}}/api/special/{{linked.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flightUuid": null
}

### 期望：source = null、flight_uuid = null


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.25 收尾：删台账 + 删航班
### ⚠️ REST Client 一个 ### 块里只能有一个请求，所以这两步必须分开写
### ------------------------------------------------------------
DELETE {{host}}/api/special/{{linked.response.body.$.id}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.26 删航班（航班删除本身也会级联清掉名下台账）
### ------------------------------------------------------------
DELETE {{host}}/api/fips/{{flight.response.body.$.uuid}}?source=manual_fips

### 期望 200：{ "ok": true, "source": "manual_fips", "id": "…", "checklists": 0, "specials": 0 }


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.27 收尾：三个资源都回到空
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/fips?source=manual_fips

###
GET {{host}}/api/special
